:PD.Type up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RTVOBJD/OBJATR'.CL var for OBJATR (10) (OBJATR)
:P.The CL variable that receives the value of OBJATR. Give a character
variable of at least 10 characters.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RTVOBJD/TEXT'.CL var for TEXT (50) (TEXT)
:P.A short description of the object, up to 50 characters, shown by the
work-with and display commands next to its name.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 50 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RTVOBJD/OWNER'.CL var for OWNER (10) (OWNER)
